{"id":"vod_md_6002","vodId":"6002","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么","name_cn":"在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231015-1/4c60385a5b1e0fb6a6c304438caa9861.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在拥有通称“地下城”的广阔的地下迷宫的迷宫都市欧拉丽，想成为冒险者并且向往像英雄冒险谭中那样的“与异性命运的邂逅”的主人公贝尔·克朗尼，在这个地方遇见了一位小“神仙”赫斯缇雅，而她正四处寻找自己“眷族”的成员。吃了不少“眷族”闭门羹的贝尔在听了其劝诱后，立马就决定加入。某日，贝尔在地下城遭到了怪物“弥诺陶洛斯”的袭击，由于水平之差而无计可施的贝尔面临走投无路的危机，而在千钧一发之际，最强冒险者艾丝·华伦斯坦出手相助。就在这一瞬间，贝尔对艾丝一见钟情。就这样，一段眷族神话正式拉开帷幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-15 08:14:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/FkxU4UXJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/yeseKSkD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/mirET0lI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/CwW4PRUF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/G4RlhpRi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/CmtleAGZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/gMppWWX4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/RLmfmExC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/fuDwYhTd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/xDOwPdVo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/kqrHHAhV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/Eng3779c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/96qLlDID/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:40:37.085Z"}